ata=RROyz5abo2CzmapFa3i%2BtskktlAoVeCAuKYOD3wquds%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Youhana Nassif</a>, Egypt, to support an animation and arts showcase in <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.animatex.net%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C4a61c7e1148949a901ad08dd43bfaa15%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638741212657835524%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=YMY3h%2FcbB5Y%2BtxIRTUn6cIIRc%2B951kCIiv%2FVVjdez90%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Cairo.</a></p>\r\n<p>Frida Andalu, Tanzania, to support visiting research in petroleum engineering at the University of Aberdeen.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://secure-web.cisco.com/1iVvzqaJp7ozB6ilB3qL0RDY3a3t4Wz0L6fHLRWGRmEc_ERXIwtCQ3fhTW_1yKyCUISSR0ap8y774dfjuTTlt5C4Di_ysIvbTqqT39y7NXshSWjUYS0b5qEtXP-ztRJOMultZzj0ocAtVb8WzaSUKSYzWkVJ4lcQ-mKcsatu9NhuT4qlHpj4Z6BA2EtHYIF1TdnmanEtw5wrx75e0r6ERFTuli1a7psbyEo9LrclNM3vMz7YC4c732YXcAwAB5P_YiplOh3hQK9E0SAHJZEmk0ty1mv3gEI_aeQ6XCt6EpuitOlHByx_ac-EO7ddn4g4niCntkXaxKeGOAaUeLWew4xCm1puOoLF6E3-Af0r6bPRTLk0CE5fWl7ZPf0So1Y_tafRXW66cFSWR0Ej7Sy6lWYmogmWnIzpd0pLU9Q7okek/https%3A%2F%2Frupert-t-quashie.org%2F\" target=\"_blank\">Rupert Tawiah-Quashie</a>, Ghana, to support his research internship at Harvard University concerning symbolic reasoning in AI models.</p>\r\n<p>I thank <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/rasheedguo\" target=\"_blank\">Rasheed Griffith</a> for his excellent work on this, and again Nabeel has created <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.evwinners.org/\" target=\"_blank\">excellent software</a> to help organize the list of winners, using AI.</p>\r\n<p><span>Those unfamiliar with Emergent Ventures can learn more 